{"metadata":{"title":"Editing Cells","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"Gingham"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Let users move from cell to cell with the keyboard and edit values in place,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like a spreadsheet."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gingham\/editingcells"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two independent options:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/navigatesByCell","isActive":true},{"text":" gives the table a focused cell","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/focusedCell","isActive":true},{"text":"): Left and Right move it from column to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"column, Tab and Shift-Tab too, Up and Down from row to row (selecting the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"row), and a click focuses the cell clicked. A ring shows it once the keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"move it; a click, Escape or the table losing the focus hide the ring.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Columns that are ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableColumn\/isEditable","isActive":true},{"text":" edit in place.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["GHTableColumn(\"name\", title: \"Name\", isEditable: true)","GHTableColumn(\"budget\", title: \"Budget\", format: .currency(code: \"USD\"), isEditable: true)","","table.navigatesByCell = true"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Ranges-of-cells","text":"Ranges of cells"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With navigation by cell, Shift with the arrow keys, a Shift-click or a drag"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selects a rectangle of cells from the focused cell"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/selectedCellRange"},{"type":"text","text":", an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCellRange"},{"type":"text","text":" of two corner cells)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Its rows are the selected rows, so the summary row’s “selected rows” scope"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers them; Copy copies the range’s cells (or just the focused cell) as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tab-separated text, which pastes into Numbers and Excel as cells; Escape"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drops the range. The corners are data source rows and column ids, so after a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sort the range spans the rows between them as shown."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Editing","text":"Editing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A double click on an editable cell, Return on the focused cell, or typing on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it (the text replaces the value) opens a text field over the cell. Typed keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"go to the field itself, so input methods (Japanese, Chinese, accents held"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"down) compose there as in any text field; the selection keeps its focused"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"look while the cell is edited. Return"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"commits and moves down, Tab commits and moves on, Escape cancels; clicking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elsewhere commits. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editCell(row:columnID:text:)"},{"type":"text","text":" starts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing from code, and so does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editColumn(_:row:with:select:)"},{"type":"text","text":", as with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSTableView"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editedRow"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editedColumn"},{"type":"text","text":" tell which cell is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"being edited (-1 when none; the row follows its record as rows move), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/abortEditing()"},{"type":"text","text":" throws the text away, e.g. before the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replaces the data."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The text is read by the column’s format: numbers in the user’s locale or with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"English separators (currency symbols aside, “25%” as 0.25 in percent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"columns), dates for date columns, text otherwise; an empty field is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".empty"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Text that isn’t a number where one is due changes nothing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The data source receives the value, like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSTableView"},{"type":"text","text":"’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tableView(_:setObjectValue:for:row:)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["func tableView(_ tableView: GHTableView, setValue value: GHCellValue, for column: GHTableColumn, row: Int) {","    switch (column.id, value) {","    case (\"name\", .text(let name)): campaigns[row].name = name","    case (\"budget\", .number(let budget)): campaigns[row].budget = budget","    default: break","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The table then reads the row again (its summaries, filter, sort and groups"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"follow), and registers the change with the window’s undo manager: Undo sets"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the old value back through the same method. The delegate’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableViewDelegate\/tableView(_:shouldEdit:row:)"},{"type":"text","text":" can keep a cell from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"being edited."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Check-boxes-and-lists","text":"Check boxes and lists"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Boolean cells of an editable column show a check box. A click on the box"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"toggles it (and selects the row), as do Space on the focused cell, Return and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a double click. A column with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableColumn\/editChoices"},{"type":"text","text":" edits in a menu"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of those values instead of a text field: Return or a double click opens it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"under the cell, with the current value checked (typing doesn’t). Both reach"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the data source and Undo the same way as text:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["GHTableColumn(\"autoBid\", title: \"Auto bid\", alignment: .center, isEditable: true)","GHTableColumn(\"status\", title: \"Status\", isEditable: true, editChoices: [","    .tags([GHTag(\"Active\", color: .green)]),","    .tags([GHTag(\"Paused\", color: .gray)]),","])"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Menu items show the values as the column displays them, tags with their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"color."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Ratings","text":"Ratings"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An editable column of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".rating"},{"type":"text","text":" values is edited without a field: a click on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a star sets it, just before the first one clears it, and a number key sets"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the focused cell (see "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/DisplayingValues"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"anchor":"Choices-that-open-on-a-click","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Choices that open on a click"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every cell of an editable column with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableColumn\/editChoices","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" shows a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pop-up button’s up-down chevron at its trailing edge, so it reads as a menu"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before it’s clicked. Set "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableColumn\/opensChoicesOnClick","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to open the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"menu on a single click (selecting the row too), like an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPopUpButton"},{"type":"text","text":" in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cell; otherwise it opens on a double click or Return."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/EditingCells"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Selection, Sorting and Actions","anchor":"Selection-Sorting-and-Actions","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/SelectionAndSorting","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/MenusAndActions","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHSorting","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTextKeys","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyProvider","doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyMaker"],"generated":true}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableColumn/opensChoicesOnClick":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"With "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"editChoices"},{"type":"text","text":", whether a single click on a cell opens the menu"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(like a pop-up button), not only a double click or Return. Every cell","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"of an editable column with choices shows the pop-up’s chevron.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableColumn\/opensChoicesOnClick","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"opensChoicesOnClick","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtablecolumn\/openschoicesonclick","title":"opensChoicesOnClick","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTextKeys":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTextKeys","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHTextKeys"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHTextKeys"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtextkeys","title":"GHTextKeys","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Collation keys made by Gingham itself, without ICU: the table’s text sorts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use them unless an app sets another provider (or none) in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/collationKeyProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHCellRange":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHCellRange"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCellRange","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A rectangle of cells between two corners (see "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GHTableView.selectedCellRange"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghcellrange","title":"GHCellRange","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHCellRange"}]},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableColumn/editChoices":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"editChoices"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GHCellValue","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Gingham11GHCellValueO"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The values an editable column’s cells choose from, in a menu instead"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of a text field (e.g. statuses as tags), or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":". Editable Boolean"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cells show a check box without them."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableColumn\/editChoices","title":"editChoices","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtablecolumn\/editchoices"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/selectedCellRange":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A rectangle of cells the user selected with navigation by cell"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(Shift with arrows, a Shift-click, a drag), or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"; its rows are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the selected rows, and Copy copies its cells (see GHCellSelection.swift)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Its corners are kept by row handle, like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"focusedCell"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/selectedcellrange","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"selectedCellRange"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GHCellRange","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Gingham11GHCellRangeV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/selectedCellRange","role":"symbol","title":"selectedCellRange","type":"topic"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/editedColumn":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editedColumn","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The index in "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/tableColumns","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" of the column being edited in a text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"field, or -1, like NSTableView’s.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/editedcolumn","title":"editedColumn","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"editedColumn","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"}]},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHSorting":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHSorting"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sorting rows by the table’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSSortDescriptor"},{"type":"text","text":"s when the data source works"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with cell values rather than key-value coded objects."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghsorting","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHSorting"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHSorting","role":"symbol","title":"GHSorting","type":"topic"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/focusedCell":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The cell the keyboard acts on, with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"navigatesByCell"},{"type":"text","text":" (drawn with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ring), or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kept by row handle, so it stays on its record as live updates insert,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remove and move rows (a removed record’s cell is no longer focused)."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/focusedCell","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"focusedCell"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Gingham14GHCellPositionV","text":"GHCellPosition"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/focusedcell","title":"focusedCell","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/SelectionAndSorting":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/SelectionAndSorting","role":"article","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/selectionandsorting","title":"Selection and Sorting","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep the selection on the same records, react to it, and sort when the user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"clicks a header."}]},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/MenusAndActions":{"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/menusandactions","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Offer your app’s actions in the rows’ context menu, and copy rows to other apps."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/MenusAndActions","role":"article","title":"Menus and Actions","type":"topic"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/navigatesByCell":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"navigatesByCell"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Whether the keyboard moves a focused cell (","type":"text"},{"code":"focusedCell","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") instead of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whole rows: Left and Right go from column to column, Tab and Shift-Tab","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"too, Up and Down from row to row; a click focuses the cell clicked.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Editable cells edit on Return, a double click or typing.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/navigatesbycell","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/navigatesByCell","type":"topic","title":"navigatesByCell","kind":"symbol"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHCollationKeyProvider":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GHCollationKeyProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Makes collation keys for the table’s text sorts (see"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"GHTableView.collationKeyProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghcollationkeyprovider","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GHCollationKeyProvider"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHCollationKeyProvider","role":"symbol","title":"GHCollationKeyProvider","type":"topic"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/abortEditing()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/abortEditing()","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"abortEditing"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/abortediting()","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Ends editing and throws the text away, like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSControl"},{"type":"text","text":"’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"abortEditing()"},{"type":"text","text":" on an NSTableView: the cell keeps its value and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"table takes the keyboard. Returns whether a cell was being edited."}],"title":"abortEditing()","type":"topic"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/GHTableView/editColumn(_:row:with:select:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/GHTableView\/editColumn(_:row:with:select:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"editColumn"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"row"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSEvent","text":"NSEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"select"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/ghtableview\/editcolumn(_:row:with:select:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Starts editing a cell by column index, like NSTableView’s: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"select"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selects the text, otherwise the caret goes after it. The event is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored (the text field takes the clicks). Unlike NSTableView, the row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"needn’t be selected."}],"title":"editColumn(_:row:with:select:)","type":"topic"},"doc://ngtable.Gingham/documentation/Gingham/DisplayingValues":{"type":"topic","role":"article","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/gingham\/displayingvalues","title":"Displaying Values","abstract":[{"text":"Return typed values from the data source and let columns format them;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pictures and videos are values too.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ngtable.Gingham\/documentation\/Gingham\/D